---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Sajad — Software Engineer"
  description="I'm Sajad, a software engineer building useful tools across backend systems, data, and applied AI."
  page="about"
  canonical="https://sajadxdp0.github.io/"
>
  <main id="main" tabindex="-1">
    <section class="intro" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
      <h1 id="intro-title">I'm a software engineer.</h1>
      <p class="intro-lead">I build cool things with code and AI.</p>
      <div class="intro-details">
        <p>I'm Sajad. I like turning complicated problems into simple, useful tools. Most of my work lives where backend systems, data, and applied AI meet.</p>
        <p>I care about building software that feels understandable, reliable, and genuinely useful—not just impressive in a demo.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="intro-link"><a href="/projects.html">See what I'm building <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
